,"characterName":"瀬名 美優樹","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14894"},"originalCharacterName":"瀬名 美優樹","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Miyuki is a young girl freshly arrived in town. She came back for the same reason as Yukito, to find her big brother. She met Yukito shortly after arriving in town in incredible circumstances."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a rather shy girl, especially with boys of her age, because she has only been to girls' schools. Having a nice face and a pleasing body, the boys often bother her and she is quite frightened of them and she sometimes calls them \"Wolves\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Oddly, even though he often teases her, she is not frightened by Yukito, who has quickly become her friend she trusts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She doesn't know how to lie, and seems messy given the state of her room ( or at all the messy stuff she probably hides in her closet when she receives Yukito ). She always has good ideas, even if they seem a bit far-fetched."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In her route, she and Yukito will participate in an event organized by the school, consisting of a three-legged race and a \"runner's speech\" at the end of the day. During the course, as they approach the finish line, Miyuki and Yukito fall violently on the ground and roll their ankles. Not wanting to give up, Yukito will then carry Miyuki to the finish line and arrive first. Some time later, it is their turn to go on stage and make their speech and it's Miyuki who speaks. Then she tells her story, her search for her brother, her arrival in the city, her meeting with Yukito... Braving her shyness, she then turns to him and confesses her feelings and asks him to go out with her, that he agrees in front of the whole school."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Some time later, she learns who her brother is, learns her true name, Miyuki ( 美幸 ) and learns she has another sibling."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14894"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f1/f119f485c93bf1fc550bf27f3d57684059f183aca76458e221a8212695846992.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6b332b1696f49f3ba7d3e1587cdc7cfa32521b5f567bccaf255c0aeae19fd38d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"卯衣","creatorId":"vndb:s1178","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1178","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1178","name":"大橋 歩夕","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:35390","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14895","characterName":"ミータ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14895"},"originalCharacterName":"ミータ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Meta ( also know as GNW-0021 Medical Treatment and nursing Automaton, MeTA ) is a robot with the appearence of a teenage girl. Initially built to help in the hospital, she was chosen to be the test subject of a large-scale experiment, the study of the relationship between humans and robots."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Meta is so advanced that it's impossible to guess that she's not human at first glance. Having an attractive face, advantageous curves and a skin of incomparable softness, Yukito quickly falls \"under her spell\" and has a hard time believing that she is only a robot."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It's her personality that betrayed her. In order to be integrated by Humans, Meta must look like a human and behave and talk like them. To achieve this, she copies the \"mimics\" of her favorite characters to express her emotions ( Fufuri ~ ). She also has a great interest for all kinds of sports activities."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is very popular at school, her closest friend seems to be Ayaka."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since his arrival, she has taken a keen interest in Yukito"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"( she produces data that she doesn't understand when she is with him, in a first time )"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her \"mother\" is Rikka."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Meta isn't a robot with a pre-programmed personality. She is a robot that \"builds herself\" with the experiences she lives, like a child growing up over the years."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She seems to understand very well the feelings that others experience and she often plays matchmakers."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She knows a lot about sex but has never experienced it."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In her route, we learn that her life span is two years and that she is nearing the end of her second year of operation."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14895"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2f/2f135436e993081349839b0e55e834b3808d386d62e45b98a3e103031760e18a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/80/80f5ec7ce5e9acf8fd98ec3e0b8dcdd808dc255f1e1d6ce49cd6ba683a5f2a4b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"杏子 御津","creatorId":"vndb:s440","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s440","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s440","name":"門脇 舞以","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:35388","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14896","characterName":"澄稀 あやか","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14896"},"originalCharacterName":"澄稀 あやか","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ayaka is the younger daughter of the famous Sumeragi family. Her father work far away from the city and her older brother too. Her only family in the town was her grandmother"},{"spoiler":true,"text":", but she passed away a year ago"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was educated as a good family girl. With her character of Tsundere, the mixture of the two personalities gives her a very seductive touch."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a bit violent with the peoples she cares. She seems very close to Meta."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In her route, she ran away from her home because she has a serious dispute with her brother. Because she has no roof for sleep, she is collected by Yukito."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Then, they start to share the room in secret because Ayaka is not an official dorm resident and the dormitory forbids two people of different sexes from living in the same room ( for ethical reasons )."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Having run away from home, her bank account is no longer powered. Meta takes her to a small neighborhood restaurant with Yukito and they get to know the owner, a very nice old man."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Ayaka finds a job of \"waitress-maid\" and the customers, mainly made up of grandfathers, does not stop to tell her that she is too cute ( which embarrasses her enormously )."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14896"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/20ba3459aeb7e9769be4cb54b08a6a93648293a1698ba664ea2e0a816a4f3804.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d5/d5a2ee21960cb4774646230b96d54fcb0913549612f477a49d2e00d142aa65df.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"蒼原 千佳","creatorId":"vndb:s1540","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1540","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1540","name":"村田 知沙","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:35391","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14897","characterName":"美馬 千毬","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14897"},"originalCharacterName":"美馬 千毬","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chimari is Yukito's adoptive sister. She is really adorable, cute and endearing, she is loved by all. She is a very ( extremely ) innocent girl, she often listens to the advice of her friend Satori ( which is much less ) and does not understand the scope of some of her actions. She loves, enormously and innocently, Yukito who became her only family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She feels so lost when Yukito returns to their hometown to find his biological younger sister that she decides to join him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is jealous of other girls who are too close to Yukito."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Because of her unhappy past, she has a hysterical fear of storms and regains her composure with Yukito only."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In her route, she expresses her fear of losing Yukito, whom she considers as her only family to Satori, who will then help her to assert herself as a woman in front of Yukito with wife-like bentos and gives her \"sex education lessons\". Chimari just understands that this is the ultimate form of loving someone and that the first time hurts, she does not know what sex is despite the ( fantasized ) lesson of her friend."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"It is ultimately Yukito who will hesitate to do the first step, knowing that his adopted little sister does not understand the scope of her actions, nor the scope of her words. His indecision hurts enormously Chimari, who does not understand why they do not do the \"thing that Satori-Chan explained ( with a nosebleeding )\" if they love each other so much..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14897"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/29/29f7dd5e39ec08935390f36b67f9c1f601973622d61a2cff06459e94db6e7794.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6d/6dcd5757b786f243977b50d11068f5b4f867b71a1474ff0341f7fba3dadda829.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"姫川 あいり","creatorId":"vndb:s925","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s925","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s925","name":"峰岸 由香里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:35389","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14898","characterName":"清宮 真結希","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14898"},"originalCharacterName":"清宮 真結希","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mayuki is Rikka's patient who suffers from general paralysis since the disaster."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her true name is Kamishina ( 神志那 ) Mayuki ( 真幸 ), she is Yukito's second younger sister and the twin sister of Miyuki."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In 15 years, she couldn't get out of her room, only spoke with Rikka and 3 nurses."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She has her brain connected to the \"brain\" of Meta in order to relearn how to use her legs, her arms ... Because of this microchip, she \"sees\" and feels all that Meta feels and experiences."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"When Meta was awake, Mayuki was sleeping and when Meta was in maintenance, Mayuki woke up with data collected by Meta during her day. Meta doesn't know about the existence of Mayuki, but Mayuki knows about Meta. They have never seen each other because they don't \"live\" at the same time but alternately."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In her route, she express her jealousy toward her twin sister, not because of his physical health but because, unlike her, Miyuki can go home every night with Yukito by her side."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14898"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/ca277e4bf61b042ee0081c3c3a57edfab450b31b97027710e05ede371abd8e33.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/023caf7f6a95fbdec1c9b1a102db52525fd8b5f166d24c6e5fe8839f7fdb4808.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"夏野 こおり","creatorId":"vndb:s5","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5","name":"田口 宏子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:35384","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c69159","characterName":"玉木 晴哉","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c69159"},"originalCharacterName":"玉木 晴哉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Haruya is the first student to approach Yukito and Miyuki. He is quite eccentric, bad student because he spends his time drying classes and he teases Miyuki ( just for fun ) quite often. In return, he is pretty teased by other girls, who puts him in funny states."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is frightened by the president of the student council and the council in general, saying that all are heartless men."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a friend who can be counted on, ready to help at any time."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In reality, he is the Vice President of the student council president and is often punished ( physically ) by Shizuka because he is too often absent to perform his duty."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69159"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6e/6edf54efdd558d80b2ca688f36eb4692d3025ca8e6d75b842aa8902e0434f6ed.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/471e10f2908ea25d80f5ca1ca913ef5a614cc4e9656dfdd2d85f67ad46516677.webp","width":190,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木島 宇太","creatorId":"vndb:s52","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s52","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s52","name":"水島 大宙","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:35387","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c69160","characterName":"藤咲 静夏","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c69160"},"originalCharacterName":"藤咲 静夏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A very kind and authoritative girl, she is"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"the student council president and"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"the hostess of the dormitory."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Very talented in domestic chores and very feminine, she plays a little role of the moth... big sister of the residents. From time to time, she gives off an aura that is quite scary and forces to submission ..."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She's very strict with the members of the student council and is described by Haruya as a man with a girl appearance."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69160"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d390a6ba850458f027b4e1f832a7f03a51278bb62d63e83f404002776d9400d7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9da62dafcbdf2ace52930e410d1c97e5df3680b948035ca33f9ef2a9ee0152f0.webp","width":146,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水簾","creatorId":"vndb:s1881","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1881","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1881","name":"水廉","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:35392","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c69162","characterName":"漁 聡里","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c69162"},"originalCharacterName":"漁 聡里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Satori is a roommate of Yukito and a classmate and best friend of Chimari."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a true pervert. Imagining everything with anything."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She likes very much Yukito calling him her \"Prince\", but we don't know if it's in a romantic way."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is very imaginative and fantasizes tremendously about brother / sister incestuous relationships."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Aside from her perversity, she is a sharp-witted girl who manages to reason well in the most stressful situations."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69162"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f3ac9986d344c0e3746a9e5bd2f9d19e285dead6eadc024fa0f6030373144764.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e605e6a8b626cc888e8bf6864137d9b99905e2a052ffd4b6c533bdcc8a90efee.webp","width":138,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"三代 眞子","creatorId":"vndb:s189","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s189","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s189","name":"米澤 円","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:35386","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c69163","characterName":"梓 弓弥子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c69163"},"originalCharacterName":"梓 弓弥子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the Principal of the High School and she helps the students find their families they lost."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Very friendly, she always offers a coffee, a fruit juice, a tea or milk to drink with little cakes to the people she receives in her office."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A very pretty woman that the protagonist would have approached if he was a little more older."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69163"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5b707bbf98734674aa3f0642ea843f6a763f5eea0039af486d44d7e2622ee5bb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e75013a505e83c5c0e04fe3e3c4a88bcb33a3a6b5b5d8d68af1b68dafcac8bb0.webp","width":137,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"斉藤雪江","creatorId":"vndb:s18928","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s18928","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s18928","name":"斉藤雪江","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:35393","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c69164","characterName":"澄稀 順也","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c69164"},"originalCharacterName":"澄稀 順也","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Junya is Ayaka's older brother, he works outside of the city and have a lot of henchmen at his service."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"They was very close before but now ..."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Ayaka and him were adopted by the Sumeragi family, some time after the disaster."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69164"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8f/8f06a9c3ae3d51c3d27cadc3715ab43c333bc1756cc7ac328fdf1888fec564f1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c694601f9cee44d31fcc791cfe2caf973e154096b0f05bc535263e8c9dbfc9d3.webp","width":156,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"村田勝利","creatorId":"vndb:s18930","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s18930","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s18930","name":"村田勝利","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:35395","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c69165","characterName":"清宮 律佳","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c69165"},"originalCharacterName":"清宮 律佳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rikka is a medical doctor who work at the hospital of the city."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She seems to be in her late 30s."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is the \"mother\" of Meta and is the legal guardian of Mayuki. Because she take care of her since 15 years, they've develop a special relationship, they love each other very much, like a mother and her daughter."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She was always a student at the time of the disaster. At that time, she had cared for some survivors and remembered taking care of a very young boy with a baby whom she loved very much. She recognizes Yukito and tells him that she is happy to see that he has \"grown up\" well."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69165"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/0437f0d375fd3d0c1ee81f34628e5e6112f8eba23454748ed1e607cbdd0df301.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c76af8093effaf7ab2348a8306cf32f8b87ff68042d39835a3c66e5f8021e814.webp","width":246,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"理多","creatorId":"vndb:s102","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s102","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s102","name":"平井 理子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:35385","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c69166","characterName":"高階 利夫","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c69166"},"originalCharacterName":"高階 利夫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Toshio is a man who lives like a hermit in the \"wild zone\" with his wife, far from the city. His wife and him has made this choice because they have lost their daughter during the disaster."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He is the true father of Chimari and was a close friend of Yukito's parents."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69166"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/dae39b745684b6090f1820eadf987d5af27c0bca97e0affbf4990a71692b2b74.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4e78a28c58d65b26c6cf886b92448f12eb4c868a2b4bdc9a3a5bb47fb95a63f7.webp","width":185,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"神山蒼紫","creatorId":"vndb:s18929","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s18929","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s18929","name":"神山蒼紫","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:35394","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c69174","characterName":"美馬 雪人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c69174"},"originalCharacterName":"美馬 雪人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"530"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yukito lost his parents and lost sight of his little sister because of a natural disaster. He was placed in an orphanage with Chimari, who also lost all her family. Over the years, they develop a brother/sister like relationship. He returned to his hometown after 15 years of absence to find his biological little sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As soon as he arrives in his hometown, Yukito realizes he has lost his wallet. He begins to look everywhere and is approached by a very pretty girl. Very shy, she is surprised by Yukito and tries somehow to ask if the wallet she found on the floor is that of Yukito. Yukito thanks her and she answers him that that she also loses things, then, they separate."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yukito then finds a wallet on the ground and sees by the identity card that it is that of the girl. After some search time, he found her and he returned her wallet."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"This is how he meets Miyuki and learns that she has also returned to the city to find her older brother and begin their adventure."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Mima\" ( 美馬 ) isn't his real last name, it's the orphanage who give this one to him and Chimari."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"His true name is Kamishina ( 神志那 ) Yukito ( 幸人 )."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69174"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/ada5b29edf6009251fd3f23731ee1677180b99673f57c32a13f83977af92302f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c6cc29c58b601d64ba336c0c63c3234858094c591b5d8352b90a1341b9cb1254.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c69214","characterName":"高階 三智","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c69214"},"originalCharacterName":"高階 三智","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is Toshio's wife."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She lives like a hermit in the \"wild zone\" with her husband, far from the city. Her husband and her has made this choice because they have lost their daughter during the disaster."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is the true mother of Chimari and was a close friend of Yukito's parents."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69214"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70abe94960810c24072baaa59e0010e0312932215111cb1855ad1eaeb13ef163.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/51/5147b795681b4798b0c1956b261975edf00e88c6b1ac59e25e0fe1f280672324.webp","width":128,"height":202,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c69264","characterName":"神志那 千歳","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c69264"},"originalCharacterName":"神志那 千歳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"sou